{"id":"n67047-1-9","stage":5,"title":"어우러지다 · 融合","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67047-1-9-1","ko":"엄마, 이 주스 참 맛있어요. 뭘로 만드신 거예요?","zh":"妈妈，这杯汁真好喝，是用什么做的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"2","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"주스","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있어요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있어요","audio":"/audio/d2df2197e887a0da537c.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘로","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ로：로/으로的口语缩合形式；뭘로相当于무엇으로，表示用什么、以什么等。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘로","audio":"/audio/e47040bfcb5dd71f0f7d.mp3"}},{"text":"만드신","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만드신","audio":"/audio/3480a4122e67658de83f.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"主要加在子女名字后面，在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女性。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f5e21bfa610e3d95d80.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67047-1-9-2","ko":"다섯 가지 야채가 어우러져 맛있는 주스가 된 거야.","zh":"五种蔬菜混合在一起，就成了好喝的蔬菜汁。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五。","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}},{"text":"가지","meaning":"种，项，类别，个","explanation":"가지：种，项，类别，个。","readings":[{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59921","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}},{"text":"야채가","meaning":"蔬菜","explanation":"야채：蔬菜；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"야채","audio":"/audio/36d7e2795dabf3c6d89a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90066","senseId":"1","lemma":"야채","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야채가","audio":"/audio/629cbc45416ad8696ac2.mp3"}},{"text":"어우러져","meaning":"融合，交融","explanation":"어우러지다：融合，交融；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"어우러지다","audio":"/audio/de865e3806ea2db05ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67047","senseId":"1","lemma":"어우러지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어우러져","audio":"/audio/34773eee71a91c10bd4c.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있는","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있는","audio":"/audio/5adc05669a4242e46918.mp3"}},{"text":"주스가","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스가","audio":"/audio/4288c4ce01ffd29a59d1.mp3"}},{"text":"된","meaning":"做成，用……做","explanation":"되다：做成，用……做；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"9","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된","audio":"/audio/1c4305152ccc1be2241e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0d616c5afd4feb13","term":"다섯","zh":"五","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3","entryId":"58111","definition":"四加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["다섣"]},{"id":"b16bec1ce2b95619","term":"가지","zh":"种，项，类别，个","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3","entryId":"59921","definition":"表示事物种类的数量单位。","pronunciation":["가지"]},{"id":"36d7e2795dabf3c6","term":"야채","zh":"蔬菜","audio":"/audio/36d7e2795dabf3c6d89a.mp3","entryId":"90066","definition":"在田里种植，主要以叶子、茎干或果实供使用的农作物。","pronunciation":["야ː채"]},{"id":"de865e3806ea2db0","term":"어우러지다","zh":"融合，交融","audio":"/audio/de865e3806ea2db05ba5.mp3","entryId":"67047","definition":"多个在一起而形成一个。","pronunciation":["어우러지다"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"做成，用……做","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"由某种材料或成分构成。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/90bfa5fc7fed6f738531.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.345,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67047","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，这杯汁真好喝，是用什么做的？","五种蔬菜混合在一起，就成了好喝的蔬菜汁。","我只要看到别人哭，就会不知不觉地跟着流泪。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，这杯汁真好喝，是用什么做的？","五种蔬菜混合在一起，就成了好喝的蔬菜汁。","我只要看到别人哭，就会不知不觉地跟着流泪。"],"answer":1}]}
